From: Bradley G Smith <bradley.g.smith@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 3 Oct 2026 15:23:46 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] Fix bash completion file

- Replace bash shebang with completion text
---
 contrib/completion/bash/docker | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/contrib/completion/bash/docker b/contrib/completion/bash/docker
index a78b08a6e4..4a18fa037e 100644
--- a/contrib/completion/bash/docker
+++ b/contrib/completion/bash/docker
@@ -1,9 +1,9 @@
-#!/usr/bin/env bash
+# docker completion                                        -*- shell-script -*-
 # shellcheck disable=SC2016,SC2119,SC2155,SC2206,SC2207,SC2254
 #
 # Shellcheck ignore list:
 #  - SC2016: Expressions don't expand in single quotes, use double quotes for that.
 #  - SC2119: Use foo "$@" if function's $1 should mean script's $1.
 #  - SC2155: Declare and assign separately to avoid masking return values.
 #  - SC2206: Quote to prevent word splitting, or split robustly with mapfile or read -a.
 #  - SC2207: Prefer mapfile or read -a to split command output (or quote to avoid splitting).
-- 
